sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Joining User
    participant F as Frontend (RoomRouteClient + Provider)
    participant S as Socket Server
    participant R as room.service
    participant O as Room Owner

    U->>F: Open /room/{roomId}
    F->>S: room:join(roomId, userId, name, email)
    S->>R: isMember(roomId, userId)?

    alt Existing member
        R-->>S: role = owner/editor/viewer
        S-->>F: room:snapshot + fs:snapshot + presence:update + collab:history
        F-->>U: Enter room
    else Not a member
        S->>R: upsertPendingJoinRequest(...)
        S-->>O: room:join-request
        S-->>F: room:error(code=pending_role_assignment)
        F-->>U: Waiting for owner approval

        O->>S: room:assign-role(roomId, userId, editor|viewer)
        S->>R: verify owner + assignRole + clearPending
        S-->>O: updated room:snapshot
        S-->>F: room:snapshot + fs/presence/chat bootstrap
        F-->>U: Enter room with assigned permissions
    end

    Note over F,S: Viewer: read-only\nEditor: file + code edits\nOwner: editor rights + role assignment
